	(text "Pin naming conventions are relatively simple. \n- For power, press [P] and use power symbols, rather than creating net labels.\n			- For custom power symbols, create a net label and attach a PWR_FLAG to it.\n\n- Signal and other labels should be short and descriptive.\n			- You can break multiple-word labels like CAN Positive into CAN_P, etc. "
